    "skill.dragonminez.ultrainstinct.desc":  "Universal divine form tree. Sign has a 3.5x core multiplier and 50-70% dodge chance; Mastered and True reach the 5x endgame tier with 65-82% and 88-97% dodge chances. Higher tiers dodge farther and consume less energy. Hairless races receive matching body colors.",
    "skill.dragonminez.ultraego.desc":  "Single-tier universal destroyer form with a 5x endgame core multiplier. Purple eyes and hair/body coloration, an aggressive hit-reactive aura, and damage that increases as health falls.",
    "skill.dragonminez.supersaiyan.desc":  "Saiyan transformation tree. God reaches 3.6x, Blue and Rosé reach 4.25x, and their Evolved forms reach the 5x endgame tier. Rosé forms grant damage and life restoration; Rage reaches 3.25x, gains its anime-style yellow aura with a cyan body outline, and grows stronger as health falls.",
    "skill.dragonminez.racial_alien": "Adaptive Physiology",
    "skill.dragonminez.racial_alien.desc":  "Adaptive Physiology builds 4% resistance whenever the same damage type hits repeatedly, up to 20%. Adapting to a different threat replaces the previous resistance.",
